# Sketchfab zip archives (keep extracted gltf/glb, not zips)
apps/web/public/models/**/*.zip

# Raw Sketchfab source models — 140MB that NOTHING loads.
#
# The game loads the COMPRESSED copies instead: characters from
# public/characters/glb/*.glb (9.5MB for all four, vs 110MB raw here — Sentinel
# alone is 68MB raw and 3.1MB as glb), and the only environment it ever fetches
# is scifi_stage, which stays tracked below.
#
# Kept on disk deliberately, not deleted: these are the sources a re-export or a
# re-bake would start from. They just have no business in a deploy. Same reason
# the zips above are ignored.
#
# Verified unreferenced before untracking: no string, template literal or
# dynamic path anywhere in apps/web/src resolves into either directory.
# Re-check with:  grep -rn "models/characters" apps/web/src
apps/web/public/models/characters/
apps/web/public/models/environments/rpg_environment/

